From fcc20f9db909b9f2ce96affc28ccaeea127e6f3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jesus David Saavedra Latorre <iam.jesusd88@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 22:34:01 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 08/26] feat(digitizer): add two finger edge swipe for back and
 forward

Two fingers whose midpoint starts in a left or right edge zone and moves inwards tap DIGITIZER_EDGE_SWIPE_BACK_KC (Cmd+[) or DIGITIZER_EDGE_SWIPE_FORWARD_KC (Cmd+]) once and consume the gesture. Other motion falls back to scroll or pinch without losing motion. Opt-in via DIGITIZER_MOUSE_EDGE_SWIPE_ENABLE, enabled in the mac keymap.
