+| `DIGITIZER_EDGE_SWIPE_BACK_KC`                | `G(KC_LBRC)` | `Cmd+[`: back, from the left edge                            |
+| `DIGITIZER_EDGE_SWIPE_FORWARD_KC`             | `G(KC_RBRC)` | `Cmd+]`: forward, from the right edge                        |
 
